	(text "DESIGN INTENT: panel covers the 30x30 mm Core1106; the carrier aperture clears underside parts.\nThe modelled top envelope is about 2.6 mm, leaving ~0.6 mm nominal in a 3.2 mm cavity. Specify\ninside-corner radius <=0.75 mm and validate solder standoff, display fit, and thermals on first article."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 610 550 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "cb88dbd0-4b02-4b83-a4a8-7abd31c14f2e")
	)
	(text "DISPLAY FIRMWARE: RGB666 data D0-D17 plus CLK/DE/HSYNC/VSYNC. ST7789V serial setup uses\nSDA/SCL/D-C/RESET; RGB-mode CS and TE are intentionally not connected. Initial timing target:\n~17 MHz pixel clock, HS 30/HBP 30/HFP 60, VS 4/VBP 4/VFP 8; validate against the exact panel lot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 610 575 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
		)
